,</span> <span begin="11.447" end="11.922">פילאטיס</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有氧运动，普拉提…</span></p><p begin="12.938" end="13.532" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="12.938" end="13.532">יש!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶！</span></p><p begin="14.062" end="16.773" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.062" end="14.187">גל!</span> <span begin="14.187" end="14.813">שתים</span> <span begin="14.813" end="15.092">עשרה</span> <span begin="15.092" end="15.754">בלילה!</span> <span begin="15.754" end="16.127">תכבה</span> <span begin="16.127" end="16.294">את</span> <span begin="16.294" end="16.551">הרעש</span> <span begin="16.551" end="16.773">הזה!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小盖！这都深更半夜了！快把你放的这噪音给我掐了！</span></p><p begin="16.932" end="18.226" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="16.932" end="17.158">אבל</span> <span begin="17.158" end="17.476">למה?</span> <span begin="17.476" end="17.618">זה</span> <span begin="17.618" end="18.226">מזרחית!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但为什么啊？这是东方流行乐啊！</span></p><p begin="18.373" end="19.615" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.373" end="18.511">לא</span> <span begin="18.511" end="18.666">מעניין</span> <span begin="18.666" end="19.282">אותי!</span> <span begin="19.282" end="19.413">תכבה</span> <span begin="19.413" end="19.509">את</span> <span begin="19.509" end="19.615">זה!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">老子不管！给我关掉！</span></p><p begin="19.778" end="20.469" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="19.778" end="20.234">לא</span> <span begin="20.234" end="20.469">רוצה!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不要！</span></p><p begin="29.362" end="30.146" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="29.362" end="29.752">Aiwa,</span> <span begin="29.752" end="30.146">aiwa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燥起来，燥起来</span></p><p begin="39.354" end="