10.946">the-</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们准备好迎接——</span></p><p begin="4:11.344" end="4:11.757" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:11.344" end="4:11.757">RIOT</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RIOT 了吗！</span></p><p begin="4:30.129" end="4:30.993" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:30.129" end="4:30.551">Aiwa,</span> <span begin="4:30.551" end="4:30.993">aiwa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燥起来，燥起来</span></p><p begin="4:30.779" end="4:32.657" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:30.779" end="4:31.142">נו,</span> <span begin="4:31.142" end="4:31.408">נו!</span> <span begin="4:31.408" end="4:31.792">אבא,</span> <span begin="4:31.792" end="4:32.187">נו!</span> <span begin="4:32.187" end="4:32.443">נו,</span> <span begin="4:32.443" end="4:32.657">נו!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别呀，别呀！老爸，求你了！求求了！</span></p><p begin="4:33.341" end="4:34.360" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="4:33.341" end="4:33.693">אבא,</span> <span begin="4:33.693" end="4:34.360">אבא!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">老爸，老爸！</span></p><p begin="4:35.956" end="4:37.865" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:35.956" end="4:36.375">שום</span> <span begin="4:36.375" end="4:36.692">מזרחית</span> <span begin="4:36.692" end="4:37.012">לא</span> <span begin="4:37.012" end="4:37.385">תהיה</span> <span begin="4:37.385" end="4:37.865">פה!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以后这屋里不准放任何东方流行乐！</span></p></div></body></tt>